{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2021-05-20 16:06:00', 'title': 'SWISSMEDIC GRANTS GOOD MANUFACTURING PRACTICE MULTI-PRODUCT LICENSE TO BIOGEN BIOLOGICS FACILITY IN SOLOTHURN, SWITZERLAND', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MASS., MAY 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BIOGEN INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: BIIB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS NEXT GENERATION MANUFACTURING FACILITY IN SOLOTHURN, SWITZERLAND HAS RECEIVED A GOOD MANUFACTURING PRACTICE (GMP) MULTI-PRODUCT LICENSE FROM THE SWISS AGENCY FOR THERAPEUTIC PRODUCTS (SWISSMEDIC).'}